/* zh-Hant translations of App/Info.plist strings (the English text lives in project.yml). Voice input (the mic
   button) asks for the first two on its first tap; speech is recognised on the iPhone only. Departure reminders
   「該出發了」 ask for the location (When In Use) the first time the user says where they need to be and when, asks
   when to leave, or asks how long a trip takes. Only the app's Info.plist declares them, so the extensions, which share this folder, never use them. This folder
   also makes XcodeGen list zh-Hant in the project's knownRegions, so keep the file. */
"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "點麥克風就能用說的輸入計畫，不用打字。語音會在這支 iPhone 上轉成文字，不會錄音存檔，也不會傳送到任何地方。";
"NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription" = "你說的話會在這支 iPhone 上轉成文字，讓你用說的輸入計畫。語音不會錄音存檔，也不會傳送到任何地方。";
"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "當你問什麼時候該出發、去某地要多久，或告訴助理你要在什麼時間到哪裡時，Smart Schedules 會用你的位置當作出發地，經由 Smart Schedules 的伺服器傳給 Google 地圖規劃路線和交通時間。Smart Schedules 不會保存你的位置。";
